<title>UK: Associated Brit Foods H1 pretax profit up.</title>
<headline>Associated Brit Foods H1 pretax profit up.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty four weeks to March 1, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		  14.5		 vs    14.3</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	    4.25		vs     4.25</p>
<p> Pretax			201.00		vs   198.00</p>
<p> Turnover		  2,659.00		vs 2,678.00</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 187 and 209 million stg. The company said sterling's strength had knocked 11 million stg off the profits.</p>
<p>Full company name - Associated British Foods Plc.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
